ewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3039\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%A5%E9%AF%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"泥鯭的士\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%A5%E9%AF%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"泥鯭的士\"><img alt=\"泥鯭的士\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B3%A5%E9%AF%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"泥鯭的士\">泥鯭的士</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>S02</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>装置式未来</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：303904</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3039/303904/安安-1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3039/303904/安安-1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3039/303904/安安-2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3039/303904/安安-2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3039/303904/7月20日 (1).mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3039/303904/安安-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3039/303904/安安-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3039/303904/安安-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">没有科学家能拒绝在瓦维洛夫综合体工作。农业和生物学的发展方兴未艾，在月壤上种出植物已经不再是梦想。耐高温作物解决了干旱地区的饥荒问题，科学家们正兴致满满地向着火星与木星进发。<br />尽管这里的植物多种多样，对于泥鯭的士来说，只有Lily称得上瓦维洛夫璀璨的明珠。聚合物为植物学的发展提供了无限可能，包括培育出一朵特别的百合花。<br />“你饿了吗，Lily？”她轻抚百合花洁白丰盈的花瓣，“长得好快啊，究竟是哪种成分起了作用？”<br />栽培床上的“井字棋”还没分出胜负，这一步种玉米，下一步种番茄，是她和Lily无聊时的消遣。Lily的食谱日渐丰富，从前只从聚合物中汲取养分，近期却跃跃欲试地对着能量密集处伸展花叶。泥鯭的士戴好手套，在Lily被判定过于危险而终止实验前，她得好好研究下这一新趋势。<br />“Lily啊，要是你进化出了什么危险功能，他们想把你‘处理’掉，咱们就得走为上计啦！”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"303904\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303907.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b7/Belonging-303907.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">安全观测眼镜<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Safety Goggles</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>《实验室安全准则》中要求研究员实验时必须佩戴的眼镜，戴上它能够观测植物内部的生长状态，同时屏蔽可能的实验污染。<br />从受访者对其研究成果极尽亲昵的态度来看，或许有该设备无法防护的污染悄然出现了。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303908.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f2/Belonging-303908.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“花香袭人”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Essence Extractor</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />20<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>受访者为研究对象所改造的液体抽取与分析装置。她认为，这些经提取的植株分泌物具有辅助研究超自然能量的价值。<br />“人类不能直接接触的能量，植物未必不可以，不要傲慢是科学和做人的第一准则啦。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303909.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f4/Belonging-303909.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“废物利用”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"One Man's Trash\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在某次实验不小心将鞋带损坏后，受访者从废弃箱中找到了一条设备连接线作为临时替代。<br />很快她意外地发现，这将是鞋带史上最好的发明——结实耐用、长短适宜，还有恰到好处的金属装饰，最重要的是不用花一分钱！</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B11.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 共生花1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B11.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B11.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B11.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B11.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B11.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B11.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B12.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 共生花2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B12.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B12.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B12.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B12.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B12.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%85%B1%E7%94%9F%E8%8A%B12.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">共生花 <small style=\"color: grey\">Symbiotic Lee-ly</small></span></span>"}}